152	// TestSourceCIDRFilterBoundaryStreamBehavior drives a mixed stream through
153	// the /12 filter: range-edge hits through source_ip and src_ip, a mapped
154	// spelling of the first range address, the just-outside addresses, a genuine
155	// IPv6 source whose tail equals an in-range address, an absent source, a
156	// blank line, and an out-of-range line whose timestamp is invalid. The
157	// admitted events keep input order, physical line numbers, their normalized
158	// dotted source and their extra fields with no filter marker; the invalid
159	// line is a counted failure with its reason and no event; everything else
